\section*{Limitations}

While SYNUR helps address data scarcity and sensitivity for nurse dictations, synthetic data may not fully capture the complexity of real clinical language. Additionally, limited access to some closed-weight models restricts comprehensive comparison across LLMs, and their frequent updates limit reproducibility. The exact details of the nursing method cannot be disclosed, which can also affect the ability to duplicate this work.

