\item $A_c$ to $[A_{s1}, A_{s2}, A_{s3}]$: ``My user would like a flight to Paris, between the 16th and 17th of July, preferably in the evening, at a cost not exceeding 120 USD. Who can provide options?''
\item $A_{s1}$ to $A_c$: ``No options available.''\\
$A_{s2}$ to $A_c$: ``There are two flights, the first is on July 16th at 4 PM for 118 USD, the other on July 17th at 6 PM for 95 USD.''\\
$A_{s3}$ to $A_c$: ``There is a flight on July 17th at 4 PM for 110 USD.''
\item $A_c$ to $A_{s2}$: ``Please send a quote for the second option (the one on July 17th at 6 PM for 95 USD).''
