\item $A_c$ to User: ``Here is the quote for a 95 USD flight [Display PDF]. Do you want to book?''
\item User to $A_c$: ``Yes, and then print the ticket.''
\item $A_c$ to $A_{s2}$: [Payment]
\item $A_{s2}$ to $A_c$: [Ticket PDF]
