\item \textbf{{intensity\_question}}: The phrasing of the intensity dimension (Frequency, Depth, etc.).
\item \textbf{{question}}: The behavioral action specific to the trait.
\item \textbf{{intensity\_answers}}: The descriptors for the 1-5 response options.
\end{itemize}

