 By a straightforward property of iterated conditioning, $p_{T|(S|R=\rho)=\sigma} = p_{T|(S,R)=(\sigma,\rho)}$.
 Also, by definition of $R$ and $S$, for all $\sigma,\rho \in \State$,
 \[\rho \in \Supp(R) \wedge \sigma \in \Supp({S_{|R= \rho}}) ~\iff ~
 \sigma \in \Supp({S}) \wedge \rho = \RState{\sigma}{\FV(\Phi)} \, .
 \]
