\title{\textsc{Matching, Unanticipated Experiences, Divorce, Flirting, Rematching, Etc.}\thanks{We thank Kirill Rudov, Gaoji Hu, and Tyler Hoppenfels for helpful discussions and comments. Burkhard gratefully acknowledges financial support via ARO Contract W911NF2210282.}}

