Duchin \citep{Duchin2018paper} explores the use of generating multiple ensemble maps by using Markov Chains, and comparing the output to actual districts. This offers a gerrymandering identification technique that is not solely based on compactness scores, but has yet to be implemented alongside current redistricting criteria. 

