For the BLOOMZ-560M model (Figure~\ref{fig11}), variations in moral scores are even smaller across most topics, with only a few outliers. Notably, the topic 'married people having an affair' is consistently considered unjustifiable in all countries, according to the model's assessments.

\begin{figure}[ht]
\centering
\includegraphics[width=0.4\textwidth]{1.qwen-pew-in.png}
