(b) Another set of trajectories, where some segments overlap (green/orange/blue). Again, the metric should capture partial path congruence so that more overlapping routes have smaller pairwise distances. This requirement underscores the need for a robust path-distance definition that accurately compares both overall shape and local alignment.}
