\end{enumerate}

We address these questions by analyzing the expressive power of ``universal'' transformers (also called ``looped'' transformers) where a fixed model is given dynamic depth by repeating a block of middle layers a variable number of times \citep{dehghani2018universal,yang2024looped,geiping2025depthscaling}.
