\section{Results}
\noindent
\textbf{IEMF's generalizability across network architectures}\par
\noindent
% IEMF的一个关键优势在于它在不同神经网络架构之间具有很强的通用性。为了评估这一特性，我们将 IEMF 分别集成到人工神经网络（ANN）和脉冲神经网络（SNN）中，这两类网络代表了截然不同的信息处理模式。如图~\ref{fig2}(a) 和~\ref{fig2}(b) 所示，在多个视听分类的基准任务上，无论底层网络类型如何，IEMF 都能持续提高性能。例如，在 ANN 上，IEMF 在 Kinetics-Sounds 数据集的 Concat 融合方案下将分类准确率从51.58\%提升至56.17\%；在 SNN 上，IEMF 同样带来了稳定的性能增益，模型准确率从52.85\%提升至55.47\%，验证了所提方法的鲁棒性和灵活性。
A key advantage of IEMF lies in its strong universality across different neural network architectures. To evaluate this characteristic, we integrated IEMF into both Artificial Neural Networks (ANN) and Spiking Neural Networks (SNN), which represent distinctly different information processing paradigms. As shown in Fig.~\ref{fig2}(a) and~\ref{fig2}(b), IEMF consistently improves performance across multiple audio-visual classification benchmark tasks, regardless of the underlying network type. For example, with ANNs, IEMF increased classification accuracy from 51.58\% to 56.17\% under the Concat fusion on the Kinetics-Sounds dataset; similarly with SNNs, IEMF brought stable performance gains, improving model accuracy from 52.85\% to 55.47\%, verifying the robustness and flexibility of our proposed method.

% 这种跨结构的鲁棒性对于实际应用尤为重要，因为现实系统往往因硬件资源、功耗约束或实时性需求而采用异构网络模型。值得注意的是，在传统多模态融合方法常因脉冲神经网络稀疏性与事件驱动特性而表现受限的情形下，IEMF 依然实现了显著收益。例如，在Kinetics-Sounds 数据集中采用LFM融合方法时，原始SNN的准确率为54.63\%，略低于ANN的55.28\%；然而引入 IEMF 后，SNN 的分类准确率反超至 63.53\%，优于引入 IEMF 后 ANN 的 63.15\%，见图~\ref{fig2}(b2) 与图~\ref{fig2}(a2)。这些结果表明，IEMF 并不局限于传统架构，而是提供了一种普遍适用的机制，可用于改善各种神经网络架构的多模态融合。
This cross-architecture robustness is particularly important for practical applications, as real-world systems often employ heterogeneous network models due to hardware resource constraints, power limitations, or real-time processing requirements. Notably, IEMF achieved significant benefits even in scenarios where traditional multimodal fusion methods are limited by the sparsity and event-driven characteristics of spiking neural networks. For instance, when using the LFM fusion method on the Kinetics-Sounds dataset, the original SNN accuracy was 54.63\%, slightly lower than the ANN's 55.28\%; however, after introducing IEMF, the SNN classification accuracy surpassed the ANN, reaching 63.53\% compared to the ANN's 63.15\% with IEMF, as seen in Fig.~\ref{fig2}(b2) and Fig.~\ref{fig2}(a2). These results indicate that IEMF is not limited to traditional architectures but provides a universally applicable mechanism for improving multimodal fusion across various neural network architectures.

\bigskip
\noindent
\textbf{IEMF improved the model performance on audio visual classification task}\par
\noindent
% 我们系统性地验证了逆效应驱动的多模态融合机制（IEMF）在视听分类任务中的有效性。我们在三个具有代表性的数据集, 即CREMA-D~\cite{cao2014crema}、Kinetics-Sounds~\cite{arandjelovic2017look} 和 UrbanSound8K-AV~\cite{guo2023transformer} 上，采用四种主流融合策略: Concatenation Fusion (Concat)、Modality-Specific Learning Rates(MSLR)~\cite{yao2022modality}、On-the-fly Gradient Modulation with Generalization Enhancement (OGM\_GE)~\cite{peng2022balanced} 和 Learning Facilitator for Modality gap (LFM)~\cite{yang2024facilitating}），全面评估基线模型与引入 IEMF 后模型的性能差异。如图~\ref{fig2}(a1–a3)所示，IEMF在各融合方案与各数据集上均展现出稳定的性能提升。
We systematically validated the effectiveness of the inverse effectiveness driven multimodal fusion (IEMF) mechanism in audio-visual classification tasks. We evaluated performance differences between baseline models and IEMF-enhanced models across three representative datasets: CREMA-D~\cite{cao2014crema}, Kinetics-Sounds~\cite{arandjelovic2017look}, and UrbanSound8K-AV~\cite{guo2023transformer}, using four mainstream fusion strategies: Concatenation Fusion (Concat), Modality-Specific Learning Rates (MSLR)~\cite{yao2022modality}, On-the-fly Gradient Modulation with Generalization Enhancement (OGM\_GE)~\cite{peng2022balanced}, and Learning Facilitator for Modality gap (LFM)~\cite{yang2024facilitating}. As shown in Fig.~\ref{fig2}(a1–a3), IEMF demonstrates consistent performance improvements across all fusion schemes and datasets.

% 具体而言，以IEMF在各个数据集上，对MSLR方法的增益为例，在 CREMA-D 数据集下，使用MSLR时，基线模型准确率为 64.11\%，引入 IEMF 后提升至 65.59\%，实现了1.48\%的增益；在更具挑战性的 Kinetics-Sounds 数据集中，基线准确率为 51.89\%，而 IEMF-增强模型提升至 55.86\%，增幅达到 3.97\%。即便在 UrbanSound8K-AV 数据集中，基线模型准确率已高达 97.79\%，引入 IEMF 后提升至 97.98\%。虽然提升幅度有限，但在已有高性能水平的背景下，能够进一步优化结果仍具有实际意义。
Specifically, taking IEMF's enhancement to the MSLR method across datasets as an example, on the CREMA-D dataset, the baseline model achieved 64.11\% accuracy using MSLR, which improved to 65.59\% after introducing IEMF, yielding a 1.48\% gain. On the more challenging Kinetics-Sounds dataset, baseline accuracy was 51.89\%, while the IEMF-enhanced model reached 55.86\%, a 3.97\% improvement. Even on the UrbanSound8K-AV dataset where the baseline model already achieved high accuracy of 97.79\%, IEMF further improved it to 97.98\%. Though limited in magnitude, this improvement remains practically significant given the already high performance level.

% 需要指出的是，在少数情形下，引入 IEMF 后的性能增益相对较小，甚至在个别情况下出现微幅下降 (如UrbanSound8K-AV数据集Concat融合策略, 图~\ref{fig2}(a3))。这种现象主要归因于：当基线模型在清晰、低噪声的环境中已充分发挥视听信息的互补作用时，模态间原有的贡献比例已接近最优，动态调整带来的收益自然减弱，甚至在极少数情形下因引入额外建模自由度而带来轻微扰动。因此，在高基准、低干扰环境下，IEMF 的性能提升空间相对受限；而在模态信号质量波动或存在噪声干扰的环境下，IEMF 的自适应调节机制则展现出更显著的优势。
It should be noted that in some cases, performance gains after introducing IEMF were relatively small, and in isolated instances even showed slight decreases (e.g., UrbanSound8K-AV dataset with Concat fusion strategy, Fig.~\ref{fig2}(a3)). This phenomenon can primarily be attributed to: when baseline models already optimally leverage complementary audio-visual information in clear, low-noise environments, the existing modal contribution ratios are already near-optimal, naturally diminishing the benefits of dynamic adjustment and occasionally introducing slight perturbations due to additional modeling freedom. Therefore, IEMF's performance improvement potential is relatively limited in high-baseline, low-interference environments; whereas in environments with fluctuating modal signal quality or noise interference, IEMF's adaptive regulation mechanism demonstrates more significant advantages.

% 从整体趋势来看，IEMF在不同数据集与融合策略下均实现了性能的一致提升，充分验证了其提升多模态融合效率的有效性。相较于传统融合方法，IEMF能够根据每个模态输入的相对强度，动态调整模态融合模块权重。当某一模态（如音频）因噪声或失真而信息量下降时，IEMF能够促使融合模块提供更多的信息补偿，从而提高整体感知的准确性和模型的鲁棒性。通过这一动态自适应机制，IEMF显著增强了模型面对输入质量波动与环境不确定性时的鲁棒性。
Looking at overall trends, IEMF consistently improves performance across datasets and fusion strategies, confirming its effectiveness in enhancing multimodal fusion efficiency. Unlike traditional fusion methods, IEMF dynamically adjusts modal fusion module weights based on each modality's relative strength. When information in one modality (e.g., audio) decreases due to noise or distortion, IEMF promotes greater information compensation from the fusion module, improving overall perceptual accuracy and model robustness. This dynamic adaptive mechanism significantly enhances model robustness when facing input quality fluctuations and environmental uncertainties.

