In contrast, with IEMF (green curve), the unimodal branch maintains higher, more stable accuracy throughout training with significant early performance advantages. This confirms IEMF not only optimizes multimodal fusion but effectively mitigates modal interference, promoting better unimodal feature learning and generalization.

