% 在更具跨模态噪声的 K-S-CI 中，LwF 由 59.89 \% 攀升至 62.79 \%（+2.90 \%），SSIL 由 63.31 \% 升至 65.18 \%（+1.87 \%），AV-CIL 则由 70.63 \% 增至 72.49 \%（+1.86 \%）。
% 面对类别规模最大的 VS100-CI，LwF 从 59.06 \% 增至 60.72 \%（+1.66 \%），SSIL 从 68.21 \% 升至 70.01 \%（+1.80 \%），AV-CIL 由 70.15 \% 提升至 70.76 \%（+0.61 \%）。
% 九组对比全部取得正向增益，平均提升约 1.63 个百分点，凸显 IEMF 的一致有效性。
After introducing the IEMF method, the models achieved stable accuracy improvements across all datasets.
On AVE-CI, LwF increased from 54.06 \% to 56.00 \% (+1.94 \%), SSIL improved from 56.19 \% to 58.12 \% (+1.93 \%), and AV-CIL slightly increased from 61.86 \% to 61.94 \% (+0.08 \%).
In K-S-CI, which features more cross-modal noise, LwF rose from 59.89 \% to 62.79 \% (+2.90 \%), SSIL improved from 63.31 \% to 65.18 \% (+1.87 \%), and AV-CIL increased from 70.63 \% to 72.49 \% (+1.86 \%).
For the largest scale dataset VS100-CI, LwF improved from 59.06 \% to 60.72 \% (+1.66 \%), SSIL from 68.21 \% to 70.01 \% (+1.80 \%), and AV-CIL from 70.15 \% to 70.76 \% (+0.61 \%).
All nine comparisons showed positive gains, with an average improvement of approximately 1.63 percentage points, highlighting the consistent effectiveness of IEMF.

% 在图~\ref{fig3}(b-d)中，每个子图最下面一行的线图展示了每个连续任务后的平均准确率变化曲线。可以观察到，与基线模型相比，IEMF模型的准确率下降曲线明显更加平缓。这表明，IEMF在跨任务知识转移过程中，能够增强模型保留已有知识的能力，同时有效整合新类别的信息，从而显著缓解了灾难性遗忘现象。
In Fig.~\ref{fig3}(b-d), the line graphs in the bottom row of each subfigure show the average accuracy changes after each continuous task. Notably, compared to baseline models, the accuracy decline curves of IEMF models are significantly more gradual. This indicates that IEMF enhances the model's ability to retain existing knowledge during cross-task knowledge transfer while effectively integrating information about new categories, thereby significantly mitigating catastrophic forgetting.

% 为了进一步理解IEMF带来性能提升的内在机制，我们分析了其在训练过程中的融合动态行为。IEMF 并未显式引入与特定任务绑定的可学习参数，而是根据单模态与多模态信号有效性的变化，自适应调节融合模块的更新动态，从而在持续学习过程中隐式地实现了对不同任务阶段模态变化的适应。通过逆有效性原理引导的训练过程，模型能够在权重更新中自然适应模态可靠性的变化，从而在感知条件波动时，降低对单一模态的过度依赖。得益于这一自适应优化策略，IEMF不仅提高了所有任务的平均准确率，还维持了更平滑的性能衰减曲线，即使在不断引入新任务的过程中，也能保持较高的整体性能和跨任务知识连贯性。
To further understand the internal mechanisms behind IEMF's performance improvements, we analyzed its fusion dynamic behavior during training. IEMF does not explicitly introduce learnable parameters bound to specific tasks, but rather adaptively regulates the update dynamics of the fusion module based on changes in the effectiveness of unimodal and multimodal signals, thereby implicitly adapting to modal variations across different task stages during continuous learning. Through the training process guided by the inverse effectiveness principle, the model can naturally adapt to changes in modal reliability during weight updates, thus reducing over-reliance on a single modality when perceptual conditions fluctuate. Benefiting from this adaptive optimization strategy, IEMF not only improves the average accuracy across all tasks but also maintains a smoother performance degradation curve, preserving high overall performance and cross-task knowledge coherence even as new tasks are continuously introduced.

