\section{Conclusion}
% We report the comprehensive mathematical details in implementing differentiable Gaussian splatting.
% We provide a full Python API for \texttt{gsplat}, making it ready for future plug-and-play research.
This report has provided the detailed derivations used in implementing differentiable Gaussian splatting in the \texttt{gsplat} library.
We have covered the essential aspects for both forward and backward passes, offering a comprehensive reference for researchers and practitioners.
Furthermore, we have provided a complete Python API exposing all computational components of forward and backward rasterization.
This API is designed to facilitate modification of each part of the computational graph to encourage further development and improvement.

